</span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Allows the party to pass through the locked vine doors, including the one in the <a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\">Overgrown Tunnel</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-351&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;581</span>, behind which lies an alternative entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. Only one party member needs to wear a mask to lead the whole party through the locked vine doors.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Uncanny_Sight\">Sources of Uncanny Sight</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">Whispering 